  "source_statement": "Let ABC be a triangle with AB = 3, AC = 8, BC = 7 and let M and N be the midpoints of AB and AC, respectively. Point T is selected on side BC so that AT = T C. The circumcircles of triangles BAT , M AN intersect at D. Compute DC.",
